{"id":"f76d845ba95c","publishedAt":1791125026000,"posts":[[{"text":"目次"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://otonary.net/archives/23899#toc1","text":"2026年8月 おすすめ新曲 洋楽編　◎いちおし◎"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://otonary.net/archives/23899#toc2","text":"2026年8月 おすすめ新曲 洋楽編 全20曲"},{"br":1},{"text":"2026年8月 おすすめ新曲 洋楽編　◎いちおし◎"},{"br":1},{"text":"The new album ACT III coming July 17th!! "},{"br":1},{"text":"ACT III pulls from every Kasabian album we’ve made. The highs, the lows, the chaos and the beauty."},{"br":1},{"text":"We’ve always been inspired by film and storytelling and this record lives in that world. These songs were shaped by true events, little scenes, fragments of life and moments of bliss."},{"br":1},{"text":"Can’t wait for you to hear it x "},{"br":1},{"text":"pre-order the album: "},{"text":"https://t.co/vAvigBS9fz"},{"br":1},{"text":"— KasabianHQ (@KasabianHQ) "},{"href":"https://x.com/KasabianHQ/status/2039639119068832197?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw","text":"April 2, 2026"},{"br":1},{"text":"カサビアンの新譜、驚異の先行シングル4曲連続投下でブチ上げてて凄いしサマソニ同様Nothing Better Than Thisがアルバムのハイライトになってて良いな……と思ったのも束の間飛び込んでくる新曲のSilver Apple Eyesがまた気持ちよく踊れる曲なので隙がないんすわ #Kasabian"},{"br":1},{"text":"https://t.co/uu9r08c4SQ"},{"br":1},{"text":"— たしなみ (@Metalbito465) "},{"href":"https://x.com/Metalbito465/status/2096737787567632757?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw","text":"September 6, 2026"},{"br":1},{"text":"カサビアンの新作"},{"br":1},{"text":"『ACT III』(2026)"},{"br":1},{"text":"サージがメインヴォーカルを担当するようになってから3枚目のアルバム"},{"br":1},{"text":"\n新体制も今や違和感なし"},{"br":1},{"text":"\nダンス、サイケ、ポップの多彩な要素を帯びた楽曲も大仰さがそぎ落とされサージの声質に合っているよね"},{"br":1},{"text":"Hippie Sunshine – Kasabian"},{"br":1},{"img":"https://s0.wordpress.com/mshots/v1/https%3A%2F%2Ft.co%2Fs8ggu3SHG2?w=160&h=90"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://t.co/s8ggu3SHG2","text":"https://youtu.be/RHb-BPpZWoU?si=xK8PjBhekT6WGoYF"},{"br":1},{"href":"https://t.co/s8ggu3SHG2","text":"t.co"},{"br":1},{"text":"https://t.co/tNsz5v0J1N"},{"br":1},{"text":"— hirockblog (@hirockblog) "},{"href":"https://x.com/hirockb